      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2091.png",
      "downloads": 10804,
      "favourites_count": 42,
      "description": "<p><strong>THIS MOD IS ONLY COMPATIBLE WITH 4.0.x</strong></p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>This mod currently does or has contained fixes authored by Kaeno, Chomp, dirtbikercj &amp; DrakiaXYZ</strong></p>\n<p><strong>This mod is NOT their responsibility but they do deserve credit for their work.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Do not report problems to them with this mod.</strong></p>\n<hr />\n<ul>\n<li>Fix Cultist Circle Direct Rewards breaking after doing a single non-repeatable direct reward (acidphantasm)</li>\n<li>Fix door on Customs not being unlockable by Military checkpoint key (dirtbikercj)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>This will be obsolete if another version is released after 4.0.13.</p>\n<hr />\n<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">INSTALLATION</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ol>\n<li>Download Temporary Fixes</li>\n<li>Open the downloaded zip file</li>\n<li>Select the BepInEx folder in the zip file</li>\n<li>Drag the user folder from zip file into your SPT folder</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Demonstration Video (yoink):</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mZ1aLrW.gif\" alt=\"mZ1aLrW.gif\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">UNINSTALLATION</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ol>\n<li>Delete <code>/ROOTSPT/Bepinex/plugins/acidphantasm-temporaryfixes</code></li>\n<li>Done</li>\n</ol></div></div></div>\n",
